    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creator of Omno, Kibu is an atmospheric adventure game about seeking wisdom in the heart of nature.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.poster.avif?t=1754313334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.webm?t=1754313334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.mp4?t=1754313334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a solitary monk dwelling in the wilderness. Use the power of your staff to climb, glide and fight your way through a series of stunning worlds. Commune with the spirits of the land and gradually rebuild the ruined temple you call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through a range of unique environments and seek out ancient spirits\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the enigmatic teachings of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of your staff to glide, climb and traverse wild landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up a collection of fish, bonsai and other treasures as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a tactile, flowing combat system to overcome foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the gods to resurrect a temple ruin into a lush natural sanctuary\u00a0  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the creator of Omno, Kibu is an atmospheric adventure game about seeking wisdom in the heart of nature.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.poster.avif?t=1754313334\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.webm?t=1754313334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193150/extras/ac8a2a2d934c364bc7948a612b8c0f03.mp4?t=1754313334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a solitary monk dwelling in the wilderness. Use the power of your staff to climb, glide and fight your way through a series of stunning worlds. Commune with the spirits of the land and gradually rebuild the ruined temple you call home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through a range of unique environments and seek out ancient spirits\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the enigmatic teachings of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of your staff to glide, climb and traverse wild landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up a collection of fish, bonsai and other treasures as you explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a tactile, flowing combat system to overcome foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the gods to resurrect a temple ruin into a lush natural sanctuary\u00a0  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
